ki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/vjZhbwHghUW6SeyR9TTcEj1gu440cbkU.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"もう～、先生は私に甘えちゃダメですよ。 でもたまにでしたら…大目に見てあげますよ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/pkor3wwjNmh0PO21wz0Z8Pxd5s5Uhz4k.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ふふっ、今日もよろしくお願いいたしますね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/dGF5jCKQboJt7IUrwePCHEazCUxNoRqO.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"は～い、シュンですよ～","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/Qq9B8wPcXOjWs4kH0rM5QKQlzpAigSgj.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"いい子、いい子～","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/x9bcSb8is7lG9oWOmGj41VCeu7Mhc61Q.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"また触ると… こらっ、って叱っちゃいますよ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/6ICaJ1yZdLNaPPdN5dRUxkgKVJM3LAl8.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ようこそ、先生。お食事になさいますか、お風呂に入られますか？ それとも…授業？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/MJN4zAN43S4sk0frEHeWUydsWWQ3an2n.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"前回、途中で終わってしまった授業を再開しましょう、ふふ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/MnnWoSoInWHRi8CvfjYTYw2lDqiMoAa6.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あら、お目覚めになりましたか。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/wvlrZCDWfALFN8Gc4GFd86FsylaOEId5.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日は…本当に楽しかったです。ふふ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%