qjM.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Tactic_In_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"さぁー、かくれんぼスタートね！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/47D7aSEDYciGlOkbLSW4E0yEVyekGdz1.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"えらいえらーい。みんなよくできました！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/MGPrOypjFDaalduwkEFzSTE2ZQ4dDI2Z.ogg"},{"description":"Shun_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"よくできましたみんな。おうちに帰ったら復習するのを忘れないでね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/CYS7RSKJRLrFMDxvEB1jVzrPn1kqdeSE.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"shun_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"小朋友们，来这边。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/jYX4TJ2lJT5vTCDdklGHFxoictLqxI3m.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"当心不要迷路哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/gJd3ZxmZN0S8k5yMByoS2RpcUCPQiWPG.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"哎哟，谢谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/wvaICRs2nqmNB3Gjo1u81wuqtoBqtOEd.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"我没办法坚持了……对不起……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/msKEAr9qeHVMnLpUQ0NzLU2u7iGapavr.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"我要开枪了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/5M91WeaGxTe5npZcWYuL8cFi3MiLd9Iy.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"一，二。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/odIUtQAWLKX1zIDzPPakCBYfiAB7eb04.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"做好准备哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/AajUQJh4Ozffh0u1kY5UsAkvyheR7fyK.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"我们去下一个地方吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/lDcoDg4aBT0BWoIic3DCaX12FrTjjLEn.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"感谢大家的辛勤工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/vNTfhbeWrG95nlfPBEn6qnOeZ5ZfpNsZ.ogg"},{"description":"shun_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"下次我们要好好相处哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/0NHrFPwzOVrJTtXQBnkDOyDFm0eT1AtP.ogg"},{"description":"shun_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"哎呀，真可爱……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/3my0ab8T3EchvhdPUBL9Xho0A6XLveVS.ogg"},{"description":"shun_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"呵呵呵，太讨人喜欢啦~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/ylTLnVdxr7P5gIKVh4VitmzVdM9TDvaP.ogg"},{"description":"shun_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"呵呵，下次就带大家来这里一起训练吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/nXjQL68IkzbyRUmlmueKinBqKqIQkdiA.ogg"},{"description":"shun_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"还没有到午睡的时间呢……可是总觉得有点困……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/cqCNkfPRQgJMWCSPvddjOf2PRlfsKD8u.ogg"},{"description":"shun_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"不知道凛华有没有好好照顾孩子们呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/MUEPCfq4vfxv9FZ2Kb3pj4Wpv3AOG5lO.ogg"},{"description":"shun_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"嘿咻。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/