ason_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"玄武商会那边送来了一些月饼，梅花园的孩子们已经吃过了，剩下的就由我和老师一起分享吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/VEQ1UeLU2N6gvFKL9wtktpSZyVi4o815.ogg"},{"description":"shun_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，新的一年也请老师多多关照啊~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/WApat45ormNMeN4iq5zz8wzNi34NbuaU.ogg"},{"description":"shun_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"嘘，老师。请小心别让人发现，圣诞老人是您假扮的哦。 孩子们纯洁的心灵，可是最珍贵的宝物。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/lX6X1d6ghJlt8zPUfyaR420zE23B9Iy7.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"大家没有受伤吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/oXitWdW2MWHbQkBMg5dahapBZdwtYVRh.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"对不起，都是因为我不够谨慎。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/AdZ8gCqQQmBOVi94JUqUpHpnYmlO7Zvw.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"不听话的坏孩子在哪里啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/sw8pBxPlbo6X6xGfINE9tvJtt8Wag8oI.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"来，开始捉迷藏了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/CRCjL19WpVtfTlkIb1zxmBu2AbyVC1yu.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"很棒很棒，大家都做得很好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/HZFg8wiWc8m8G2RvcCkbQWRMgEdVBDpa.ogg"},{"description":"shun_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"大家都干得很好，回家之后别忘了复习哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%98%A5%E5%8E%9F%20%E7%9E%AC/6Xo2rHazuTaatraipiAinDAEIBEKTh93.ogg"},{"description":"shun_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blu